{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07897","headline":"陪卢明府泛舟回作 · 孟浩然","name":"陪卢明府泛舟回作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"百里行春返，清流逸兴多。\n鷁舟随雁泊，江火共星罗。\n已救田家旱，仍医俗化讹。\n文章推後辈，风雅激颓波。\n高岸迷陵谷，新声满櫂歌。\n犹怜不才子，白首未登科。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07897.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07897","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}